<p>I’m well aware that I may have a bit of an <a href="/posts/2022-08-01_a_new_font/">obsession with fonts</a>. I don’t think that’s too unusual for someone who works in tech, however. Sites like <a class="link-external" rel="external" href="https://www.programmingfonts.org/">Programming Fonts</a> exist to let people test drive and compare a bunch of different fonts. Just for fun, I thought I’d write up some of the features I look for in a programming font that I’ve come to deliberately pick out.</p>